# A paratroop drop with the mouse (mighty=1), written by hand. In June 1941 the Axis side gives
# COMMANDS and Paratroop by their letters, which Mickey also takes, and Enter at the From menu
# (Berlin). The To menu waits in Mickey; a click on Munich (city 36, at 280, 163) chooses it there
# (menu's selex, WW2C.BM line 1262). The drop ends at a pause, which a click ends. Then a right
# click (Esc) at COMMANDS, and Files, Quit, Yes by their letters.
#! seed 1941
#! cfg side=2 mighty=1

# The pause before the title menu; Start NEW Game; Start Year 1941; the briefing.
prompt
mouse 100 100
press 1
release 1
prompt
mouse 60 263
press 1
release 1
prompt
mouse 165 231
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
press 2
release 2

# COMMANDS, Paratroop, Berlin.
prompt
digest
text c
prompt
text p
prompt
digest
key enter
# The To menu: Munich, clicked on the map.
prompt
digest
mouse 280 163
press 1
release 1
# The pause after the drop.
prompt
digest
press 1
release 1

# COMMANDS: a right click.
prompt
digest
press 2
release 2

# Files, Quit, then Yes by its letter, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
prompt
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
digest
text y
repeat space
